@startuml
title Sequence - UC1: Mã hóa dữ liệu bằng ECC-ECIES
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false

actor "Người dùng" as User
participant ConsoleMenu
participant CipherFactory
participant SecureMessenger
participant EccCipher
participant EllipticCurve
participant "ECPoint / KeyPair" as ECCData
participant AuditLogger

User -> ConsoleMenu : handle_encrypt()
ConsoleMenu -> User : Yêu cầu dữ liệu, thuật toán,\nthông tin khóa
User --> ConsoleMenu : Dữ liệu + ECC + khóa phù hợp

ConsoleMenu -> CipherFactory : create_asymmetric(ECC, keyPair)
CipherFactory -> EccCipher : __init__(key_pair, curve=P-256)
EccCipher -> EccCipher : load_public_key(public.export())\nload_private_key(private._get_material())
EccCipher -> EllipticCurve : validate_public_key(ECPoint(x, y))
EllipticCurve --> EccCipher : hợp lệ (hoặc CryptoException - QT6)
EccCipher --> CipherFactory : cipher
CipherFactory --> ConsoleMenu : ICipher

ConsoleMenu -> SecureMessenger : set_cipher(cipher)
ConsoleMenu -> SecureMessenger : send(data)
SecureMessenger -> EccCipher : encrypt(data)
note right of EccCipher
  CipherBase.encrypt kiểm tra dữ liệu
  rồi gọi hook do_encrypt (Template Method)
end note

EccCipher -> EccCipher : generate_private_key(SECP256R1)\n(ephemeral, mỗi lần mã hóa)
EccCipher -> EllipticCurve : validate_public_key(ephemeral point)
EccCipher -> EccCipher : derive_shared_key(ephemeral, recipient)\nECDH + HKDF-SHA256 -> AES-256
EccCipher -> EccCipher : AESGCM.encrypt(nonce 12 byte, data)
EccCipher --> SecureMessenger : ephemeral(65) || nonce(12) || ct+tag

SecureMessenger -> AuditLogger : MessageProcessed(event)
AuditLogger -> AuditLogger : on_message_processed(event)
SecureMessenger --> ConsoleMenu : ciphertext
ConsoleMenu --> User : Hiển thị bản mã
@enduml
